WHY IT IS A DEFECT AND NOT AN INCONVENIENCE (§3 step 1):
  Amendment 1 built these nine lists by splitting ADR-0020 §11.12's evidence
  COLUMN on whitespace. That column is prose with parentheticals, so a
  parenthetical became field names and an enum VALUE became a field: `locking`
  is a value of `missing_capability`, `pre_first_unlock` of `lock_reason`,
  `cloud` of `scope`. Every damaged list is exactly EIGHT entries long, and the
  real trailing fields — the errno/syscall/os_error_code/platform set W-6 put on
  OS-facing codes — were cut off past that bound.

  TWO OF THEM ARE SECURITY DEFECTS, not noise. The declared-set filter is the
  MECHANISM behind "no secrets in telemetry": twinvpn_types::Evidence::new
  refuses a key a code does not declare, which is why the rule is enforced
  rather than reviewed. And for these two codes it was admitting exactly the
  field the ADR forbids:
    - STORE.READONLY_FILESYSTEM declared 'path', while §11.12 says "the path
      itself is SENSITIVE and pseudonymized".
    - STORE.RESTORED_FOREIGN_HOST declared 'host' and 'identifiers', while
      §11.12 says "the host identifiers themselves are SENSITIVE and MUST NOT be
      attached".
  No emitter in the tree attaches any of the debris, so the exposure was latent.
  A latent hole in the mechanism that enforces a MUST NOT is still the mechanism
  not working.

WHY IT IS COMPATIBLE (§3 step 5):
  evidence_fields is NOT among check_registry_append_only.py's
  FROZEN_REASON_ATTRS — domain, class, severity, terminal, user_actionable,
  remediation_class, scope — and none of those moved on any code. ADR-0015 §11.2
  rule 1 ("a code MUST NOT be renamed, and its semantics MUST NOT change once
  ACTIVE") is therefore satisfied: no code's identity or classification changed.
  No field number, no enum value, no wire format, and no generated binding moved;
  contracts/gen/** is byte-identical. On the wire the only consequence is
  SchemaDescriptor's reason_registry_version 3 -> 4, which is what that field is
  for. A receiver that met one of the removed keys would have dropped it as
  undeclared under the OLD registry too — nothing could legitimately have been
  emitting them.

SCOPE, MEASURED RATHER THAN ASSUMED (§3 step 4):
  All 254 codes Amendment 1 introduced were re-read against their owning
  document's §11 table; 120 declare evidence and 119 of those rows were located.
  The damage is confined to ADR-0020, because it is the only §11.12 table whose
  evidence column carries parentheticals of that shape. ROUTE.FAMILY_ASYMMETRY
  and NET.PATH.DEAD_NO_ALTERNATE were flagged by the sweep and checked by hand:
  both are correct, and the flag was the sweep matching the wrong table row.

WHAT IS NOT CLAIMED:
  STORE.RESTORED_FOREIGN_HOST is left with `binding_mismatch` alone. The other
  eight regained the OS-error set because their own truncated lists still
  carried part of it, so the intent is in the data; this one was cut before
  reaching it and its condition is a binding comparison rather than a failed
  syscall, so the fields are not invented back. If an emitter later needs them,
  that is an append under the ordinary rule.

APPROVED BY (§3 step 6): the repository owner, explicitly, on 2026-08-28, on
